{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve finally found the mysterious <strong>Dang Darn Island</strong>! Now the only thing standing between you and the legendary <strong>Gold Idol</strong> is an ancient temple filled with slithering snakes, pointy spikes, flamethrowers, poison darts, and a grumpy volcano who just might lose his cool at any moment.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piece of cake, right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Smash Pots!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave a trail of ceramic mayhem in your wake as you search for useful items to help you on your quest. Be careful, though! Some of those innocent looking containers will give you more than you bargained for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/Pots.gif?t=1750089637\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dodge Traps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are more than a few ways to get caught off guard in this labyrinth of doom. Watch your step and try not to get stabbed, poisoned, sliced, or fried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/Traps.gif?t=1750089637\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Search For Clues!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you can put the pieces together and crack the code? Use everything at your disposal to open the path to fortune and glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/Clues.gif?t=1750089637\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Collect Stickers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade stickers can give you an edge in all kinds of situations. Level up to collect more and customize your kit on every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/Upgrades.gif?t=1750089637\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Invite Your Pals!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s rough out there for a lonely adventurer. Call up some friends and share the pain\u2026er\u2026uh\u2026fun with online or local split screen multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/extras/Pals.gif?t=1750089637\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1802370?t=1750089637","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/ef08646484aafd8726b42e287492440ef11f44c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750089637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/d9e1c4e8b3ade61533a6d9197b6f72ce7bd717b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750089637","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1802370/d9e1c4e8b3ade61533a6d9197b6f72ce7bd717b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750089637","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve finally found the mysterious <strong>Dang Darn Island</strong>! Now the only thing standing between you and the legendary <strong>Gold Idol</strong> is an ancient temple filled with slithering snakes, pointy spikes, flamethrowers, poi